{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "0362ee78a3a4190ec4939f018095237b61a3e1c1bc7a85f2de4c30bcc21515d3", "ja": "また君に会うために", "zh": "为了能再次遇见你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "68d17833b4003db76c1bcb4e4c4bac4015e268f8b2925728581894ca61a61117", "ja": "劇場のみんなとまつりを会わせてみた美也と\n未来。だが記憶は戻らなかった。お互い謝り\n始めた美也とまつりに、未来は、ふたりとも\n謝らないで！　と諭す。その明るさのおかげ\nで、笑顔を取り戻すふたり。", "zh": "美也和未来试着让剧场的大家与茉莉见了面。但她的记忆并没有恢复。美也和茉莉开始互相道歉时，未来劝说道：“你们两个都不要道歉！”多亏了她的开朗，两人重新露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "692ed96f4e71a1a57b2c7683e29bc13048a86cb5925bcd15b6865abf53335efa", "ja": "（まつりの記憶を取り戻そうと、美也と未来は\n劇場のみんなにまつりを会わせたのだが……）", "zh": "（为了让小祭恢复记忆，美也和未来让她和剧场的大家见了面，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f9a1f88b6a6d7090445c491662a535352ee51b5e02f353a4080ef34f4a5cd98", "ja": "朋花ちゃんやエミリーちゃんにも会ったけど……\nまつりちゃんの記憶、戻らないね～。", "zh": "朋花和艾米莉也见过了，可是……\n小祭的记忆还是没有恢复呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "245ead48e7995d77c6df790ff103b26dea2b9733b225d9d1119023aeeb202c1d", "ja": "そうですね～……。", "zh": "是啊～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "20bb12c1f34fbae1c3ddd850ea9b1bcb17a8c3ab324c7fa0ff6a82c356054140", "ja": "（レッスンは、まつりの記憶がない事以外は順調だ。\nこのままの状態で、公演を迎えるしかないのか……？）", "zh": "（除了茉莉失去记忆以外，课程进行得很顺利。难道只能以现在的状态迎接公演了吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "497554005bf03d8e06e1fe5a2b90d6bb9d07326fc30793d025e81a07c77a544b", "ja": "まつりちゃん……{$P$}さん、\n未来ちゃんも、ごめんなさい～。", "zh": "茉莉……还有{$P$}先生，\n未来，对不起哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "3685026c4d3b60bb1a8ebecf824465a045adb19fbba093d2992a4a8b645ec0f9", "ja": "ええっ！？　な、なんで美也ちゃんが謝るの！？", "zh": "诶诶！？为、为什么美也要道歉啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "b01a5d0b38d95ed18cf6f9fc79ed05eae63251851c659eab17cdadb257ac30e5", "ja": "でも私、まつりちゃんに約束したんです～。\n『絶対に、取り戻してみせますからね～』って……。", "zh": "可是我和茉莉约好了的呀～。\n说好“一定会重新拿回来的～”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b1c2789a031ec7710b0044912e8b047f280c7cfcdbb80bada87bd03149164f6c", "ja": "美也……。", "zh": "美也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "554d38207aa72d43c69ab3247095f43b4262fbe9a19c61f128c398900540992d", "ja": "美也ちゃん、謝らないで……。\nそれに……謝るなら、私のほうだよ……。", "zh": "美也，不要道歉……而且……真要道歉的话，也该是我道歉才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "d65ad27dd804b34b2cfe086cbd8463042fea9e5065b13b30d59df4a176adefd1", "ja": "まつりちゃん？", "zh": "茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "0b3f39ff18f67cc993930a0c28409917ca665ce8b48cbefffaee205145576ca8", "ja": "今日まで会った人たちは、みんな私のこと知ってた。\nなのに私は、みんなのことが思い出せない……。", "zh": "直到今天遇到的人，大家都认识我。\n可我却想不起大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c558aa3ee676c88ce88b12d153d5b1d66a5cd0d6a01a730fc503cecf69380514", "ja": "まつり……。", "zh": "茉莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "72d15f8515e4b6cf2412db2782002f83b46879c3b40c38c609f66cb17b87fb1f", "ja": "うぅ……まつりちゃん、美也ちゃん！！\nふたりとも、謝っちゃダメ～っ！", "zh": "呜呜……小祭、美也！！\n你们两个都不许道歉～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "95d2ed1a7a50cfa689b2b9aea89b5bfa248ef26426a169edd86735d2a7ae917e", "ja": "未来ちゃん？", "zh": "未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "67ddd956f732ac6b4c0be366e2e3f97e2431edebd64a1a11faf5a013ab384db6", "ja": "絶対絶対、ぜーったい、なんとかなるよ！\nだって私たち、ユニットだもん！　仲間だもん！", "zh": "绝对绝对，绝——对会有办法的！因为我们是一个组合嘛！是伙伴嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8116c527452e5cb4bbe7c00a0c79c4e7154b0996a2e144b1e08b4c81b69b12c", "ja": "それに、もしまつりちゃんの記憶が戻らなくても！\n私、まつりちゃんのこと好きだもん！", "zh": "而且，就算小茉莉还是想不起以前的事！\n我也喜欢小茉莉呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "96a9f57402a7b80db5648b7187044ca082c6ca56cd581e0a1ca2b52a097c112e", "ja": "今のまつりちゃんも、前のまつりちゃんも、\n同じくらい大好き！　だから、謝らなくていいの！", "zh": "现在的茉莉也好，以前的茉莉也好，我都一样最喜欢！所以，不用道歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "5866fd23f6ff1086c9d3e923d2c7e00ece8032e1328cbe4cbb81e6adb5a8535b", "ja": "未来ちゃん……。", "zh": "未来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "5cfc6fa992c27ab4bf70484b03b9fafdcc6fc941cb99480e2dc4ac3a47b79ca7", "ja": "そうですね～。私も、同じです～。\nどっちのまつりちゃんも、大好きですよ～。", "zh": "是啊～我也是一样的～。\n不管是哪一个茉莉，我都最喜欢了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "19eb535c5c9255dd7ac386356bf3bc9153f7b31364f337274e6d2607d91e968b", "ja": "けど……思い出せないことで、まつりちゃんが\n悲しい気持ちになってしまうのは、困りました～……。", "zh": "可是……要是因为想不起来，让小祭感到难过，那就不好了～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "e23ed6a7dcf92f72683d1f172ef95533a2d55ef88c37d1ab21a3cafba00af9fc", "ja": "美也ちゃん……。", "zh": "美也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "0a2d09cc8f8bcd84ea3a89341ead06f9aaf37fc64c666202c3217f6f1e388607", "ja": "……なあ、こういうのはどうだろう？　前の\nまつりの事を、みんなで教えてあげるっていうのは。", "zh": "……那个，这样如何？大家一起把以前的まつり的事情告诉她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a7497984b62b6eacc1eac5b38f429ef0676115e567b9cef3b130f9061597937e", "ja": "たとえ、すぐには思い出せなかったとしても……\n知らないのと知ってるのとでは、違うんじゃないかな。", "zh": "即使没能马上想起来……不知道和知道，应该还是不一样的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "96ef4a7b718e2934aa5cea2ed2a51c87744f81fa3a0d4871114a31cfef916ebb", "ja": "前のまつりちゃんのことを……なるほど～。\nさすが、{$P$}さんですな～。", "zh": "关于之前的茉莉……原来如此～  \n不愧是{$P$}先生呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "f476adc8922804097e9b229be14b790baabc82159a0cdacec66f071fe767d5ce", "ja": "わかりました！　なんでも教えちゃいます！\nあっ、でも私が知ってることだけですけど……えへへ。", "zh": "知道了！我什么都可以告诉你！\n啊，不过也只能告诉你我知道的事情……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "053aedecda8b301edbd267b1be5959c9acbf9508c50b784f8651c9827eaad977", "ja": "それじゃ、早速だけど……まつり。\n知りたい事を、聞いてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "那么，事不宜迟……茉莉。\n想知道什么的话，就问问看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "16b63b902a75914f4788e37f0bae44e45a24fc722646e3ee76f3dbf7c6f3f04d", "ja": "は、はい。えっと……ねえ、ふたりとも。\nふたりから見て、私って、どんな人だったのかな？", "zh": "是、是的。那个……两位。\n在你们眼里，我是个什么样的人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "d6cbeaa439995f5b98bb985bd28478057f5c39286eebda563c213b785749e99c", "ja": "あのね、まつりちゃんはスポーツがすっごく上手なの！\nあと、少女漫画もいーっぱい持ってて……あっ！", "zh": "那个，之前说过哦，祭理在运动方面特别厉害！\n而且还收藏了好多少女漫画……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb3fe9e157f5cc058b05a0fbc0de8b27376a507001c6b6c4fbf87f8c148627d2", "ja": "まつりちゃんに借りた本、まだ返してなかった……。\nううっ……ごめんなさい～。", "zh": "我跟茉莉借的书，还没还给她……\n呜呜……对不起啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "5c49caa93fd0a98efd32f665687499227fa00d252aa7b5ad44a0887e3cac2064", "ja": "そうなの？\nふふっ、そんなのいつでも大丈夫なのに。", "zh": "这样啊？\n呵呵，那种事什么时候还都没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "fa914c45f5335331915547baa237ffe972f07e4593e4d5244c3141c3c8fae6b7", "ja": "まつりちゃんは、ウミウシさんが好きなんですよ～。\nそれに、ふわふわでキラキラしたものも好きですね～。", "zh": "小祭喜欢海蛞蝓哦～\n而且，也喜欢软绵绵、闪闪发光的东西呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "77a3896784d42412d5e8aa4cdfdf06ad3acf0ca57d77b77bff219aefed02d1b2", "ja": "あとあと、まつりちゃんはね、お姫さまなんだって！\nそうですよね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "还有还有，茉莉是个公主哦！\n对吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "3c8d2dd46784e4dbc1125cb7b4b7e8fe0b438ac8829858d34beb9f804007470b", "ja": "そうだな。こんなにすごいお姫様のいる劇場は、\n世界でもここだけかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊。拥有这么厉害的公主殿下的剧场，或许全世界也只有这里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "ca5c2dada82286fa38c92e08830aa70dded67bb9ad17b682c708a2d22ba33cf3", "ja": "そうなの？　……でも私は、すごくなんてないよ。\nふつうの女の子だと思うけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？……不过我一点都不厉害哦。\n我觉得自己就是个普通的女孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "ffdaf510fde117536c0b4e9dd88a221019c80cfe6b234aa0ac28042311a56793", "ja": "そんなことありません～。\nまつりちゃんは、私たち、みんなのお姫様ですから～。", "zh": "不是这样的哦～  \n因为小祭可是我们大家的公主呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "87d3ef2d19ca91412d5289b958ac97fcd71f1b1fc86815f194689a8b9678b9c3", "ja": "みんなの……。", "zh": "大家的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ad8f2f0b61e8fa35964a4aefc56cb5657380490afa1d7f26d3be7b2bd15682b4", "ja": "（まつり……？）", "zh": "（茉莉……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "7e4f485405a375a384b05e9087abc95c63d8e6a222b30280204bc41f91ac4f2c", "ja": "まつりちゃん……私、もっともっとがんばりますね～。\nみんなのことを思い出す方法、いっぱい考えます～。", "zh": "茉莉……我会更加更加努力的哦～。\n怎么才能想起大家，我会好好想一想的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "414fd3d4c9292f12565e374c1e35645728a65f997aa303e721c55d97a7898e7f", "ja": "うん！　私も、美也ちゃんといっしょに考える！\nあ、そうだ！　みんなにも聞いてみようよ！", "zh": "嗯！我也会和美也一起想办法！\n啊，对了！我们也去问问大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "0127a45e7fc14cdb5164f35c80abd36f072ea38179c0d589542c51b429ce6dc3", "ja": "三人寄れば、文殊の知恵と言いますし～。\n劇場には、三人よりたくさんの人がいますからね～。", "zh": "俗话说，三个臭皮匠，顶个诸葛亮嘛～  \n剧场里可是有比三个人更多的人呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "3922ccf89ef8ca66bd89854931ece7d9361e982e6e45e788558f450eede30449", "ja": "さっそく、いってきまーす！", "zh": "我这就出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "8d3a9d9695c6bf330877535018648695c077d8a54ab1d80247bdef36cd9d790d", "ja": "私も、いってきますね～。", "zh": "我也出发啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "26d6e17a042b84ac5c1eb7d11a8c265b2f35200e388309b32bb9843c2f62ed61", "ja": "まつり、追いかけなくていいのか？", "zh": "茉莉，你不去追她没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "2172e9cf9c6f89eb69e4964e3c1fddb994eb4520fd8e17eb09d927e9409c79f9", "ja": "うん。でもその前に……{$P$}さん。\nひとつ、聞いてもいい？", "zh": "嗯。不过在那之前……{$P$}先生。\n我可以问你一个问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1048_021mat", "source_sha256": "36dadffb6f9642696ce14b4d7d3651960a7d44eb9e15bec22abef92318b20ed7", "ja": "うん……あのね。美也ちゃんも未来ちゃんも、\nどうしてあんなに一生懸命なんだろう？って……。", "zh": "嗯……那个。美也和未来，为什么都那么努力呢？我在想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "507361a5d4ae628c9cc272b7458ee7e804095c38955d0ee12885fc60a5721530", "ja": "私は、他のみんなのことだけじゃなくて。\nふたりのことも、思い出せないのに……。", "zh": "我不只是想不起其他人的事。\n就连你们两个的事也想不起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "5ed8d08690560033cff888acba79bdbebdaf703419309db7c0230bcaad87226e", "ja": "それは、さっきも言ってたけど……美也も未来も、\nまつりの事が好きだからじゃないかな。", "zh": "这个刚才也说过了……因为美也和未来都喜欢小祭吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1051_p", "source_sha256": "a054daea1c747b62369fb8b1c33a691e6f95268ca9483754b0f363b1c65c1030", "ja": "たとえまつりが覚えていなくても、きっとふたりとも、\nまつりのために何かしたいんだよ。大事な仲間だから。", "zh": "即使茉莉不记得了，我想她们两个人也一定是想为茉莉做些什么。因为茉莉是她们重要的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1052_021mat", "source_sha256": "511a300c113e92c2a8a1a50c5e2ce49bfbd5dab6049c8472f2f461be481231e2", "ja": "仲間……そっか。ふたりとも、前の私のこと、\nとっても大事にしてくれてたんだね……。", "zh": "伙伴……这样啊。原来你们两个，一直都那么珍惜以前的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1053_021mat", "source_sha256": "68ec32489a356b17f9cb31354bde63bc435e081c6467bf8329f1209535d169e4", "ja": "私……もうちょっとだけ、がんばってみようかな。\nなんだか、会ってみたくなっちゃった。お姫様な私に。", "zh": "我……要不要再努力一下试试看呢。\n不知为何，好想见见那个我。公主般的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1054_021mat", "source_sha256": "ba054675b00c0f32473441cc316b2d394358ff232999fcfb6cb6af8aeb613a61", "ja": "力を貸してくれるかな、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "愿意助我一臂之力吗，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "3bbe9e14d987e163e9c01671be950256ebe079aa0f8b9245959068abca79e44e", "ja": "もちろんだ。一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "当然了。我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1056_021mat", "source_sha256": "c1e1b969293e8c768d3e57e02b76b9d29a28afa78c8761941b8550f02c2c8527", "ja": "うん……ありがとう。\n私、みんなのところにいってくる！", "zh": "嗯……谢谢。\n我去大家那里一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0121_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_04_1057_p", "source_sha256": "6cdd3dc1f699ead8b030ea6af6daee76eb6898b6e0995226744a60be9565b7f1", "ja": "（まつりの記憶が戻るか、まだわからないけど……\nみんなと一緒に、あともうひと踏ん張りしてみよう！）", "zh": "（还不知道能不能让小祭恢复记忆……但还是和大家一起，再努力一下吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
